{"ts": 1791255186.6142411, "type": "step", "step": 36, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "For a POMDP, the concise answer is: the agent never directly sees the true underlying state. It gets partial observations, keeps track of a belief/history, and chooses actions from that. So in your write-up, you can say:\n\n- State: the full hidden environment state\n- Observation: the partial information the agent receives\n- Actions: the moves the agent can take\n\nIf you want, paste your project description and I\u2019ll turn it into a polished state/obs/action definition for the build.", "intent": "give_answer", "concept": "week3-build"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: can you just tell me the answer\n[activity] t=15 messages 1m", "t": 16, "activity": [{"t": 15, "app": "messages", "minutes": 1, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.26381841230950415, "pomdp": 0.3755694140515003, "pass_k": 0.26381841230950415}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.75, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.5774138638965114, "motivation": 0.6346898353259871, "reliance": 0.6369816226735439, "persistence": 0.25174099583220066, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.31279709056453686, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2824851109524564, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 2.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.9411699999999996, "seen_posts": ["p5"]}}
